<title>PORTUGAL: Philip Morris wins bidding for Tabaqueira.</title>
<headline>Philip Morris wins bidding for Tabaqueira.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>A consortium headed by U.S. giant Philip Morris won the bidding for a 65 percent stake in Portuguese tobacco concern Tabaqueira, the Portuguese government announced on Thursday.</p>
<p>The U.S. company beat off competition from a group led by Spain's Tabacalera and the French company Sieta (Ste Nationale d'Exploitation Industrielle des Tabacs et Allumettes).</p>
</text>
